Garrulus (internal id nametracker)
Catalogue of Life

This repository contains third-party data files under their own licences. They stay separable from the code.

1. Common word lists (finder-core)
   Files:   finder-core/src/main/resources/org/catalogueoflife/nametracker/finder/dict/common-words-{en,de,fr,es,pt}.txt
   Source:  hermitdave/FrequencyWords, https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords (from OpenSubtitles)
   Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 (CC BY-SA 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/
   Changes: counts dropped, filtered and truncated; see the NOTICE file next to the lists.

2. Pensoft evaluation corpus (eval)
   Files:   eval/corpus/pensoft/gold.jsonl.gz (with manifest.tsv)
   Source:  articles of the Pensoft journals ZooKeys, PhytoKeys, MycoKeys and Biodiversity Data Journal
   Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Credit:  each article by its DOI in eval/corpus/pensoft/manifest.tsv
   Changes: markup stripped, text normalised, converted to the Garrulus document model;
            see eval/corpus/pensoft/README.md.
